DirectStorage ETW event definitions, vendored so a standalone build resolves
<dstorage_etw.h> without a PIX checkout. Placed on the include path via
DirectStorageEtwPath (Directory.Build.props); an in-tree PIX build points the
same include at its own external\DirectStorage copy instead.

  dstorage_etw.h
      Verbatim copy of the DirectStorage ETW header. The library uses the
      provider GUID and the event descriptors the dispatcher decodes. Note this
      header is not shipped in the Microsoft.Direct3D.DirectStorage NuGet
      package, which carries only dstorage.h and dstorageerr.h, so it has to be
      vendored rather than restored.
